  "mu_name": "Zienna The Weapons Merchant",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/SnowSmith01.bmd, loaded as MODEL_SNOW_SMITH (ZzzOpenData.cpp:1877). The client names her the Korean for 'weapons merchant' in ZzzCharacter.cpp's MONSTER_ZIENNA_THE_WEAPONS_MERCHANT arm; OpenMU's Version075 calls her Zienna The Weapons Merchant, gives her the Dragon set and the swords, and she repairs. Type 246, standing once in Devias at 186,47.",
